&ldquo;<U>Corporation</U>&rdquo;), according to the conditions hereof, as of the date written below. If shares of Common Stock are to
be issued in the name of a Person other than the undersigned, the undersigned will pay all transfer taxes payable with respect thereto.
No fee will be charged to the Holders for any conversion, except for any such transfer taxes.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

